WEBVTT

00:16:27.224 --> 00:16:30.302
That's God, you know.

00:16:30.326 --> 00:16:32.982
Curious historical footnote:

00:16:33.006 --> 00:16:37.823
when the Moors invaded southern Spain,
they took this custom with them

00:16:37.847 --> 00:16:40.133
and the pronunciation
changed over the centuries

00:16:40.157 --> 00:16:42.933
from "Allah, Allah, Allah,"
to "Olé, olé, olé,"

00:16:42.957 --> 00:16:46.107
which you still hear in bullfights
and in flamenco dances.

00:16:46.131 --> 00:16:49.760
In Spain, when a performer has done
something impossible and magic,

00:16:49.784 --> 00:16:52.909
"Allah, olé, olé, Allah,
magnificent, bravo,"

00:16:52.933 --> 00:16:55.300
incomprehensible, there it is
-- a glimpse of God.

00:16:56.387 --> 00:16:58.485
Which is great, because we need that.

00:16:58.509 --> 00:17:02.336
But, the tricky bit
comes the next morning,